Package: nautilus-open-terminator
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-nautilus, terminator
Enhances: nautilus
Description: Open Terminator from the Nautilus context menu
 A Nautilus (GNOME Files) extension that adds "Open In Terminator" and
 "Open Terminator Here" entries to the right-click context menu for local
 directories and remote SFTP locations.
